<title>GERMANY: BASF plans news conference on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>BASF plans news conference on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LUDWIGSHAFEN, Germany 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemicals group BASF AG on Monday said it has entered a joint venture with a biotechnology group and will announce the group's name at a news conference on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The joint venture will be based in Germany and concentrate on particularly promising biotechnology research, BASF said, declining to give more details.</p>
<p>Hans-Juergen Quadbeck-Seeger, the BASF board member in charge of research, will present the news conference scheduled for 1100 GMT in Ludwigshafen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
